5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry we forget the people behind the scenes. I shall look into the composition of the volunteer roster and conservation lab staffing and backlog.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to see where the actual failures occur. I will examine lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I'm interested in what actually brings people back. I'll check the weekend head counts across ten seasons and five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The building's limits are often ignored. I will review the structural survey of the suspended bay and evening hire bookings in the gallery.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to find where the money disappears! I'll look at loan transport costs over three seasons and mount-making charges and joiner's rate.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
