25,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"It seems our conservation lab is severely understaffed, and our volunteers are mostly from the town history circle.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Shion,,"My findings are grim. Paperwork delays have pushed back openings, and powered displays are prone to frequent breakdowns.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,May,,"Interestingly, visitors love it when someone is actually working or talking in the gallery, and mechanisms draw larger crowds.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening hires mean we can't have displays that can't be moved or closed.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Oh boy! Transport and insurance for loans are eating a huge chunk of the budget, and joiner rates are skyrocketing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shion, if powered displays are breaking, perhaps we should avoid anything too complex?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Shion,,"Exactly, Shizue. Reliability is a major issue. @Sakura, does the budget allow for expensive bespoke mounts?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, the fact that people want to see ""working"" displays is a great opportunity if we can manage the staff.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, as long as those displays don't exceed the weight limit or block the evening hire paths.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, the joiner's rates are way up! We should definitely look for things that come with their own supports.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, if the town history circle is our main volunteer group, they would be wonderful for a local theme.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, if the bay is limited, we must avoid heavy stonework or massive installations.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, but we need that ""draw"" for the visitors. A static room is a boring room.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree, but a broken or collapsed display is even worse. We need a balance.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Sakura,,And we need to stop spending all our money on shipping crates! Local is better for the wallet.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
