50,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are A: Textiles, B: City Excavation, C: Light and Motion, and D: Maritime Trade. I favor A for the volunteers.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Shion,,C is a nightmare waiting to happen with those maintenance logs. D has too much loan paperwork risk. I lean toward A or B.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,May,,"B has a working conservation bench! That fits the visitor desire for ""working"" galleries perfectly. I vote for B.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Misaki,,B's excavation finds might be too heavy for the suspended bay. A is much safer for the floor and the evening hires.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Sakura,,A is local! That means lower transport costs and fewer expensive mounts. I'm voting for A!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, B is tempting, but the conservation lab is already backlogged. Adding a public bench might be too much.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, you're right about the weight. B is risky. A is the most logical and stable choice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shizue, that's a fair point about the lab. If the staff are overwhelmed, B becomes a liability.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Misaki,,A is flexible and lightweight. It won't interfere with the evening bookings either.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A is the winner for the budget and the building!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,Shizue,,I am happy with A. It supports our community volunteers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Shion,,I concur. It avoids the technical failures of C and the logistics of D.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,May,,I can support A. The demonstration sessions with craftspeople satisfy the visitor demand for activity.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Misaki,,I agree. It is the safest option for the gallery's infrastructure.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm so excited for the textiles!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
